<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar softens to 470.00/471.00/dlr.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar softens to 470.00/471.00/dlr.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar softened to 470.00/471.00 per dollar on moderate corporate demand, traders said, as the Central Bank stayed out of the day's session.</p>
<p>The unit closed Wednesday at 469.50/470.75 per dollar.</p>
<p>Although dollar demand was modest &quot;the bolivar fell as the Central Bank did not come in at all,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>-- Silene Ramirez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
